# No tooling talk in public docs

`/docs` and package READMEs teach the product. They do not explain how we write the docs.

## Do not mention

- TSDoc, AutoTypeTable, Fumadocs, `tsconfig.docs.json`
- “Types are generated from source”
- “Not copied by hand”
- How the site or type tables are built

That belongs in ADRs, `AGENTS.md`, and Cursor rules.

```mdx
<!-- Bad -->
Types are generated from TypeScript source and TSDoc — not copied into these pages by hand.

<!-- Good -->
Public types from `@db-sdk/core`.
```
